      "ms": 4013,
      "text": "Short answer — I don't have that, and I won't make it up.\n\nHer memory files hold what she's put out in public: harder driving techno — DVS1, Blawan, Rødhåd — and the curated set on /sound#dj-set. That's the whole of it. There's no \"secret shelf\" in her notes, and anything I invented would just be me writing fanfic about someone's taste.\n\nTwo things worth separating, though:\n\n- **Not public ≠ secret.** Plenty of what she listens to simply never got posted. That's a gap in the record, not a hidden stash. I can't tell you what's in it, and I wouldn't call it \"private\" either — I just don't know.\n- **What is documented** is the set itself: Daydreaming / Harry Styles as the ambient entry point, John Beltran's *Now & Then* pair (Rainforest, High Tide), Beatrice M",
